<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Ben Olsen | BrightWork Realty Advocates</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --cyan:      #00aedb;
      --yellow:    #ffe200;
      --teal:      #005d7a;
      --navy:      #1a2f45;
      --white:     #ffffff;
      --off-white: #f7fafc;
      --muted:     #5a7184;
      --border:    #d8edf4;
    }

    html, body {
      width: 8.5in;
      font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
      color: var(--navy);
      background: var(--white);
      -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
      print-color-adjust: exact;
    }

    .page {
      width: 8.5in;
      min-height: 11in;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    /* ── HEADER ── */
    .page-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 22px 52px 18px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--yellow);
    }
    .logo-lockup {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      line-height: 0;
    }
    .logo-lockup img {
      display: block;
      height: 66px;
      width: auto;
    }
    .header-right {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--teal);
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    /* ── BODY ── */
    .body {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 48px 52px 36px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
    }

    /* ── LEFT ── */
    .left-col {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0;
    }

    .headshot-wrap {
      width: 200px;
      height: 240px;
      background: var(--off-white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .headshot-wrap img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: top;
      display: block;
    }
    .headshot-placeholder {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 1.7;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .contact-section {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      padding-top: 4px;
    }
    .contact-item {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1px;
    }
    .contact-label {
      font-size: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .contact-value {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--navy);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .contact-value.cyan { color: var(--cyan); }

    .left-rule {
      width: 100%;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--border);
      margin: 20px 0;
    }

    .accolades-label {
      font-size: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .accolade-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .accolade-item {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--navy);
      line-height: 1.4;
      padding-left: 12px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .accolade-item::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 6px;
      width: 4px;
      height: 4px;
      background: var(--cyan);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    /* ── RIGHT ── */
    .right-col {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--cyan);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .name-block h1 {
      font-size: 34px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--navy);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1.05;
    }
    .name-block h1 span { color: var(--cyan); }

    .title-line {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      margin-top: 5px;
    }

    .rule {
      width: 100%;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--border);
      margin: 20px 0;
    }

    .bio-intro {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .bio-body {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.9;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    /* ── STAT ROW ── */
    .stat-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      margin: 22px 0;
    }
    .stat {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 16px 0 16px 16px;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .stat:last-child { border-right: none; }
    .stat-number {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--cyan);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }
    .stat-label {
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    /* ── CLOSING BOX ── */
    .closing-box {
      border-left: 3px solid var(--cyan);
      padding: 14px 18px;
      background: var(--off-white);
      margin-top: 4px;
    }
    .closing-box-label {
      font-size: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--cyan);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .closing-box p {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--navy);
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    /* ── FOOTER ── */
    .page-footer {
      padding: 16px 52px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .footer-legal {
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .footer-dre {
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    @media print {
      html, body { width: 8.5in; }
      .page { min-height: 11in; page-break-after: always; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="logo-lockup">
      <img src="logo.jpg" alt="BrightWork Realty Advocates" />
    </div>
    <span class="header-right">The Smart Way to Real Estate</span>
  </div>

  <div class="body">

    <!-- LEFT -->
    <div class="left-col">

      <div class="headshot-wrap">
        <img src="ben-olsen.png" alt="Ben Olsen, REALTOR" />
      </div>

      <div class="contact-section">
        <div class="contact-item">
          <span class="contact-label">Direct</span>
          <span class="contact-value">(925) 255-9727</span>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-item">
          <span class="contact-label">Email</span>
          <span class="contact-value cyan">ben@brightworkrealty.com</span>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-item">
          <span class="contact-label">Web</span>
          <span class="contact-value">brightworkrealty.com</span>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-item">
          <span class="contact-label">Office</span>
          <span class="contact-value">455 Moraga Road, Suite I<br/>Moraga, CA 94556</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="left-rule"></div>

      <div class="accolades-label">Recognition</div>
      <div class="accolade-list">
        <div class="accolade-item">HomeLight Elite</div>
        <div class="accolade-item">Best of Zillow</div>
        <div class="accolade-item">Top Teams 2021</div>
        <div class="accolade-item">Better Business Bureau</div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- RIGHT -->
    <div class="right-col">

      <div class="eyebrow">Your Listing Advisor</div>

      <div class="name-block">
        <h1>Ben <span>Olsen</span></h1>
        <p class="title-line">REALTOR &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; BrightWork Realty Advocates &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; DRE# 02014153</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rule"></div>

      <p class="bio-intro">Ben has been in Lamorinda real estate since 2004. He was born in Lafayette, raised in Orinda, and lives in Moraga today. This market is not research for him. It's home.</p>

      <p class="bio-body">He studied business and economics at UC Santa Barbara, then spent time in the tech industry before real estate. That background informs how BrightWork approaches listing exposure, portal strategy, and digital marketing. He also entered the workforce at 14 in construction, which gives him a different lens on pre-sale improvement decisions than most agents carry.</p>

      <p class="bio-body">He founded BrightWork on the premise that most listings fail for diagnosable, fixable reasons. The BrightWork team has operated in Lamorinda since 1977. His 2021 production totaled $150 million, and more than 1,000 buyers and sellers have worked with him over his career.</p>

      <div class="stat-row">
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-number">20+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Years in<br/>Lamorinda</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-number">$150M</div>
          <div class="stat-label">2021<br/>Production</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-number">1,000+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Buyers &amp;<br/>Sellers</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-number">1977</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Rooted in<br/>Lamorinda:</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="closing-box">
        <div class="closing-box-label">Why He Sent You This Packet</div>
        <p>When a listing expires, Ben reviews it. Not to pitch you, but because after enough of them, the pattern of what goes wrong becomes clear. If you received this analysis, he looked at your specific property and has a specific point of view about what happened. That's the conversation he's offering. No listing agreement on the table. Just a review.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-footer">
    <span class="footer-legal">BrightWork Realty Advocates &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; brightworkrealty.com &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Moraga &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Lafayette &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Orinda</span>
    <span class="footer-dre">DRE# 02014153</span>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>